        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A standard interior room takes one to two days. Full exterior house painting typically takes three to five days depending on the size of the property and the weather. We'll give you a realistic timeline in your quote."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will there be much mess or disruption?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We take protecting your home seriously. Floors, furniture, and fittings are covered before we begin. We clean up fully at the end of each day and leave the site tidy when we're done."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you guarantee your painting work?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We stand behind every job we do. If anything isn't right, we'll come back and fix it — no arguments, no call-out charges. Your satisfaction is the standard we hold ourselves to."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What time of year is best for exterior painting in Kilkenny?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
